00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:44,340
Malagkip mi nga itisibibiyag

264
00:10:44,340 --> 00:10:46,340
paydayta amang alilaw

265
00:10:46,340 --> 00:10:48,340
kinunana ama pangugar

266
00:10:48,340 --> 00:10:50,340
nanto kalpasan ti talo

267
00:10:50,340 --> 00:10:52,340
aldaw. Ibilin mong

268
00:10:52,340 --> 00:10:54,340
arod ama gwardya ana na imbag

269
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:56,340
ititanem aginga iti may katlong aldaw

270
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:58,340
amangan nung mapanda

271
00:10:58,340 --> 00:11:00,340
takawin dagiti adalana

272
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:02,340
ti bangkay sa danto ibaga

273
00:11:02,340 --> 00:11:04,340
ka dagiti tataw

274
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:06,340
ana pagunga nesus.

275
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:08,340
Tanukasta ti mapasamak

276
00:11:08,340 --> 00:11:10,340
dakdakis to ti maudi

277
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:12,340
apa nang alilaw ngayom itiinmuna.

278
00:11:12,340 --> 00:11:14,340
Manghala kayo iti gwardya.

279
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:16,340
Kinunan ni Pilato.

280
00:11:16,340 --> 00:11:18,340
Kitpabantayan niyo ana

281
00:11:18,340 --> 00:11:20,340
imbag ititanem. Itikasta

282
00:11:20,340 --> 00:11:22,340
pimanaw da kit napanda

283
00:11:22,340 --> 00:11:24,340
siniraan ana imbag ititanem

284
00:11:24,340 --> 00:11:26,340
babaen itipanang markada

285
00:11:26,340 --> 00:11:28,340
itibato arikip na

286
00:11:28,340 --> 00:11:30,340
kit nangibati da kadakiti soldado

287
00:11:30,340 --> 00:11:32,340
amang gwardya.

